  "limitations": [
    "The models are separate bounded abstractions, not a mechanized Bash refinement or composed deadline proof.",
    "B27 preserves three fixture resources and does not establish safe reclamation or the full node-image lifecycle.",
    "B28 confirms one writer at post-exit observation. It does not measure exact termination ordering or cover failed stops, all shutdown paths, or ownership-safe selection.",
    "B29 tests process-group SIGKILL with a surviving filesystem. The fixture supervisor stops the Docker writer before recovery.",
    "Power-loss durability, additional crash windows, benchmark crashes, storage faults, complete writer shutdown, durable upload, deadline and reserve bounds remain pending.",
    "Raw evidence was retrieved off the diagnostic VM. No durable artifact publication is attested.",
    "Hosted execution, required-check enforcement, maintainer review, claim ratification, D2, and acceptance remain pending."
